    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d75">

                <pb facs="0781" n="631" sameAs="frus:frus1907p2/pg631"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President of Salvador to President
                    Roosevelt.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San Salvador</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-04-24"><hi rendition="#italic">April 24,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Ministers of Nicaragua and of this Republic advised me last night that peace on
                    terms honorable to both Republics was signed. In the name of the people and my
                    own I tender to you the testimonials of thanks for the good offices lent in the
                    cause of peace.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">F. Figueroa.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
